8步lora）均明显会降低生图效果。\n\n##  4、工作流中预设了qwen edit 2511的8步加速lora，经试验可以使用，但会适度降低生图质量。后续等官方出qwen image 2.1专用加速Lora后自行更换即可。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "米大 wen image 2.1 多图编辑", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#750044", "size": [514.27734375, 590.7872924804688], "pos": [-2417.552734375, 3967.194091796875], "id": 606, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 27}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "widgets_values": ["生图步数：50步  40步   25步    8步（使用25118步加速lora）\n\n该模型使用多图参考会大大增加生图时间，若单纯文生图、图生图生图25步时间约180秒左右。5图参考不使用8步Lora时25步生图时间约800秒\n\n这里添加了2511的8步加速lora，经试验可以使用，但会适度降低生图质量。\n\n若不使用加速Lora，请自行禁用lora节点"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#ffffff", "size": [243.2792205810547, 250.55279541015625], "pos": [465.4496154785156, 4318.087890625], "id": 600, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 28}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#ff0000", "size": [332.3670959472656, 76.38986206054688], "color": "#ff1414", "pos": [793.9425048828125, 3931.25439453125], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 597, "type": "Fast Groups Muter (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "😒", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 29}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [852], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": ["example.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [240.9691925048828, 326], "pos": [-68.69857025146484, 3480.88232421875], "id": 598, "properties": {"widget_ue_conne